{"resourceIdentifier":"3135","resourceName":"Henan Grouped Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"The project is to collect methane from swine manure treatment at the swine farms in Henan Province owned by the subsidiaries of the project owner. The project consists of 5 project instances, which are Xihua Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as Xihua project), Ningling Yangyixi Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as Ningling Yangyixi project), Pingyu Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project(hereinafter referred to as Pingyu project), Ningling Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project(hereinafter referred to as Ningling project), and Shangcai Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project(hereinafter referred to as Shangcai project), each owned by the respectively subsidiary company.The project treats the raw manure from 440,000 market swine and 23,000 breeding swine produced annually by anaerobic digesters, and uses the biogas generated during the treatment process for heat generation. The project owner uses the gravity and scraping systems to collect the manure automatically, and all the manure is flushed and pumped to the anaerobic digesters. After anaerobic digestion, the digestate is used for agriculture irrigation aerobically. Therefore, the reduction, resource utilization, harmlessness, and ecological utilization of the manure from the swine farms can be realized.","location":{"latitude":33.759999,"longitude":114.356662},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-06-02","endExclusive":"2022-07-03","endInclusive":"2022-07-02"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3135"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, P.R. China"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","valu